# Accepted container-scan findings (backlog E-04). Read by the `image` job in
# .github/workflows/security.yml.
#
# Empty on purpose. Add a finding only with a reason a reviewer can check and
# a date to look at it again, one ID per line, for example:
#
#   # libexample: only reachable through a feature this image never enables.
#   # Review by 2027-01-31. Accepted by <name> on <date>.
#   CVE-0000-00000
#
# Record each accepted finding in docs/security/container-scan.md as well.
